# .trivyignore — baseline for scripts/container-scan.sh (trivy 0.74.0).
# RULE: every entry carries a reason + date comment (project rule). Anything
# NOT listed here fails the scan — that is the guard.

# --- Alpine base image baseline (2026-08-15) --------------------------------
